 open for film entries to its June 2027 edition\, for feature\, mid-length 
 and short documentaries and non-fiction series.\n\nOrganisation: Sheffield
  DocFest\nLocation: Sheffield\, UK (festival 9-14 June 2027). Open interna
 tionally\; no nationality or residency restriction stated.\nAward: EXCEPTI
